Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.74,0:19:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不觉得枪里面有子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think you have any bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.91,0:19:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.34,0:19:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得你打的都是空包弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you are shooting blanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.66,0:19:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}行啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.83,0:19:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们想来硬的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You folks wanna play it the hard way?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.21,0:19:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都他妈的靠卡车站好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up against the fucking truck!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.34,0:20:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就是想这样吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this what you wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.68,0:20:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我现在感觉不太妙 我欠了你一个人情啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got this bad feeling, I owe you pretty boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.99,0:20:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们扯平了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are square.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.20,0:21:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就是揍了警察的那个家伙吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You the one, that gave the cops a beating?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.54,0:21:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不想惹什么乱子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.96,0:21:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.50,0:21:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要是教训了警察 那你就惹上乱子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because if you tuned up the cops, you are gonna have some.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.04,0:21:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是在找巴尔的摩·鲍勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just looking for Baltimore Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.97,0:21:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上车吧 小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jump in, cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.13,0:21:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我开车送你去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll give you a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.62,0:23:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去你的 混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck you, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.87,0:23:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}滚开 提利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck off, 'Tilly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.28,0:23:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我有那玩意儿 我就要塞你屁眼里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I had a dick, here is what I tell your ass to suck it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.83,0:23:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以你是说 一个人赤手空拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So your story, is that one unarmed man
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.87,0:23:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打倒了你和你的手下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}took out you and your gang,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.78,0:23:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还抢走了我的入境税款\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and pushed in my landing tax?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.96,0:23:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 弗兰克 我下次会做的更好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Frank. I'll do better next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.04,0:23:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}混乱王国没有下次 你懂这个道理的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no next time here in the Sprawl, you know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.21,0:23:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你杀了警察被送这儿 现在你连一个小喽啰都搞不定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got sad here for killing cops, and you can't handle one con?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.26,0:23:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说了 抱歉 弗兰克 我下次会做的更好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like I said, I am sorry Frank. I'll do better next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.84,0:23:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他只是运气好而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just got lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.10,0:23:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你收的每一块银币 都要上缴给混乱王国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every piece of silver you collect, goes right back to the Sprawl.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.64,0:24:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}收不上税的话 这地盘就要吃苦头了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When my landing tax goes uncollected, the city suffers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.29,0:24:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想吃苦头么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you like to suffer?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.25,0:24:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不想吃苦头 弗兰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like to suffer, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.13,0:24:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是他 就是那个混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's him. That's the mother fucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.01,0:24:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 嘿 贝克丝 - 这家伙在找巴尔的摩·鲍勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Bex. - This guy is looking for Baltimore Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.18,0:24:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一眼就能看出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Course he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.35,0:24:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}康纳·吉布森 这位是简\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Connor Gibson, meet Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.99,0:24:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很高兴见到你 简\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's good to meet you, Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.99,0:24:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就交给你了 小妞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is all yours, chica.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.49,0:24:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要去跳跳舞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'mma go dance on the pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.21,0:24:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.98,0:24:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是从哪来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where's you moving from?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.38,0:24:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}长岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long Beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.67,0:24:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是怎么进来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you in it for?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.13,0:24:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这重要吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.05,0:25:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我来说挺重要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does, for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.17,0:25:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就是来了这 没什么原因 跟大家没什么两样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here because I'm here, just like everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.37,0:26:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的一位收税员告诉我 你袭击并抢走了他身上的钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of my tax collectors told me you attacked him and then robbed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.04,0:26:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事情并不是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not exactly how it went down.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.66,0:26:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那讲给我听啊 犯人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enlighten me, convict.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.42,0:26:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杀了他 弗兰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill him Frank!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.96,0:26:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的一位手下和他的同伙们图谋不轨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your boy and his pals tried to jump me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.96,0:26:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可你还是好好的啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet you're the one who walked away.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.71,0:26:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我又没说他们得手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't say they were any good on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.55,0:26:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我揍他 弗兰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me whack him Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.76,0:26:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他只不过是他爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's nothing but a couple of drops of
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.84,0:26:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}射了一个路边妓女生出来的罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sprouted from a shit filled crack in the sidewalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.01,0:26:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们以前见过面吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have we met before?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.77,0:26:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不这么觉得 我是新来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think so. I just got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.44,0:26:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就算以前见过 我也不知道 你躲在面具后面呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if we had, I wouldn't know. You're hiding behind a mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.28,0:26:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我的地盘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my city.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.06,0:26:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不准有人这么跟我说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one speaks to me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.03,0:26:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杀了那个混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill that motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.61,0:26:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 你说我偷了东西 我什么也没偷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, you accuse me of stealing, and I didn't steal anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.62,0:26:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我为我自己辩护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I defended myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.31,0:26:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的手下自己挑事 又打不过 这不是我的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not my fault your boys weren't up to the fight they picked.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.25,0:26:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小心了 犯人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch your back convict.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.14,0:27:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你绝对不是从长岛来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're definitely not from Long Beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.20,0:27:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你似乎习惯于挑战比你强太多的人啊 犯人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're making a habit to punch above your weight... Convict!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.67,0:27:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听说你在找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Word is, you're looking for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.33,0:27:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是巴尔的摩·鲍勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baltimore Bob?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.71,0:27:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真是吃了熊心豹子胆啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your balls must be made out of titanium.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.38,0:27:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从来没见过有人敢那么跟弗兰克说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never seen anyone talk to Frank like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.60,0:27:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会开车吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.52,0:27:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会开车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.70,0:28:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是怎么进来的 鲍勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what are you in here for, Bob?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.20,0:28:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就说是因为我帮助别人离开这个世界吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just say I help people transition.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.33,0:28:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些媒体称我为"杀人博士"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Press called me Dr Kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.50,0:28:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是一位肿瘤学家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was an oncologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.16,0:28:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 我读过关于你的报道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I read about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.64,0:28:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你给400位垂死之人做了安乐死手术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You euthanize 400 dying people.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.67,0:28:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}432位 他们并非全是垂死之人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, 432, and not all of 'em were dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.71,0:28:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有些人微不足道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some were living inconsequential lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.94,0:28:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟死了没什么两样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and in as such they were already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.63,0:28:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快点 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.88,0:28:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上那卡车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the truck!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.22,0:28:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这食物归弗兰克斯坦所有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The food is property of Frankenstein!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.93,0:28:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.35,0:28:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}食物抢劫时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feeding time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.53,0:28:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们是弗兰克的追随者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disciples of Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.82,0:28:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们抢劫食物运输车 控制食物供给量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They hijack the food shipments and control the supply.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.61,0:28:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让人们饿肚子 这样更易于控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you keep the populous hungry they are easy to control.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.53,0:28:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些武器和赛车都是从哪里来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do all the weapons and cars come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.49,0:28:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}手工制造 自己动手 我们会利用各种各样的破烂零件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Handmade, home-made, we lick the bottom of the pad.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.25,0:28:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}外面送什么我们就用什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we furbish whatever sticks to our tongues.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.26,0:28:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有送好东西这些人都拿不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They never get a bit fat from outside.
