Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.76,0:54:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是你当上了这里的老大 你觉得你能应付的了么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think you can handle being king of this mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.93,0:54:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是来这比赛的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just here to race.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.97,0:54:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 但是如果你赢了呢 怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. But if you win? Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.77,0:55:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你做好准备领导他们 做出艰难选择了么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you ready to lead? To make hard decisions?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.47,0:55:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}混乱王国现在是自给自足 但是以前并非如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sprawl is self-sustaining, but it wasn't always this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.65,0:55:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我刚到的时候 这还是一片荒凉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I arrived it was a wasteland.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.02,0:55:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}维兰德国际说要将混乱王国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weyland Corporation promote this Sprawl
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.28,0:55:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打造成另类的监狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as an alternative to regular prisons.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.62,0:55:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就是一个谎言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.38,0:55:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实际上 送到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Sprawl was created
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.97,0:55:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}混乱王国的人 等于是判了死刑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as an alternative to the death penalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.09,0:55:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们把奶酪扔进来 希望我们像老鼠一样互相争斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They throw us cheese and expect us to act like rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.43,0:55:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们并没有想到我们会发展起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They did not expect us to evolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.39,0:55:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们现在正是如此 以后也是如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we are, and we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.43,0:55:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我让这个地方不再混乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I keep this place from anarchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.15,0:55:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说的这些 和这里的街头比赛有设么关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does this have to do with the street race?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.65,0:55:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那不只是街头比赛而已 我们本性如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not just a street race, It is who we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.99,0:55:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是什么人 康纳·吉布森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you, Connor Gibson?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.52,0:55:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一位无名之辈罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody special.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.36,0:55:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是你赢下了死亡飞车 恐怕就不是如此了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that could change if you win Death Race,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.26,0:56:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你打败了我的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.79,0:56:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么你会愿意冒丢失一切权力的风险呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would you be willing to risk losing all this power?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.46,0:56:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}死亡飞车给了所有人当上老大的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death race gives anyone the opportunity to become king.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.26,0:56:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有这一点激励着我们 我们将一事无成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without that to inspire, we are nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.18,0:56:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你赢了 你当上老大的第一件事是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you win, what would be your first act as king?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.22,0:56:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还没考虑过这个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't really thought about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.52,0:56:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我之所以赢了 是因为我非常清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won because I knew exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.24,0:56:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我成了老大之后 想干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what I wanted to do when I was king of this hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.11,0:56:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你不知道自己想要什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't know what you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.24,0:56:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你就会死在赛道上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you will die on the track.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.58,0:56:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}混乱王国会欢呼庆祝你的死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the Sprawl would cheer your death.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.07,0:56:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以关键的问题是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So the question is...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.74,0:56:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你到底想要什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.68,0:57:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来啊 宝贝 上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on baby, get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.61,0:57:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今晚真是疯狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was insane tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.07,0:57:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不行 贝克丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The answer is no, Bexie.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.49,0:57:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还是别当死亡飞车比赛的领航员吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't wanna ride shotgun in Death Race.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.24,0:57:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一定要参加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.13,0:57:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就跟判死刑没什么两样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a death sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.88,0:57:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弗兰克杀了我在乎的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frank has killed people I cared about.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.51,0:57:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也想出力把他干掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to be part of putting him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.38,0:57:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会考虑的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.39,0:58:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得我们能一起喝一杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought we could have a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.90,0:58:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以 梅丽是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, who is Merry?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.44,0:58:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是你最爱的时髦小妞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is she your favorite groupie,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.04,0:58:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还是你特别爱过圣诞节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or you just really into Christmas?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.00,0:58:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是我妹妹 梅雷迪思 的昵称\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's uh... My sister, Meredith.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.75,0:58:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我服役的时候她去世了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She died when I was in the service.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.47,0:58:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}连跟她道别的机会都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never got to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.14,0:58:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也无法挽回了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't change it, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.89,0:59:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看了不少 也干了不少坏事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seen a lot of bad stuff. Done a lot of bad things.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.19,0:59:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梅丽是个好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.98,0:59:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比我好 这是肯定的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better than me, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.49,0:59:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.20,0:59:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我出生在小石城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was born in, Little Rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.90,0:59:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我猜你爸爸信教吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a preacher man.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.33,0:59:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}算不上信教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.50,0:59:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我爸是个汽车修理工 一身油污\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My old man was a grease monkey in a pair of
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.05,0:59:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的乐趣就是坐在门廊上喝迪克西啤酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His idea of a good time was drinking Dixie beer on the porch,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.30,0:59:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}数着萤火虫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and, count the fireflies.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.22,0:59:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我小时候的大部分时间都呆在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spent most of my young life in
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.24,0:59:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}德克萨斯 斯威特沃特的一个废品回收站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweet water, Texas, on a salvage yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.31,0:59:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梅丽是在长岛去世的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry, passed away in Long Beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.69,0:59:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我就搬去那儿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I ended up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.43,1:00:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好消息是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, the good news is
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.43,1:00:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}V8标准变速器正常工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the V8 standard transmission and it runs,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.44,1:00:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坏消息是需要换轮胎 刹车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the bad news is that it needs tires, brakes
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.86,1:00:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发动机要大修 需要燃料电池 装甲 需要武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and toll engine over haul of it, fuel cell, armor, weapon needed
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.82,1:00:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别扯这些了 百事通 重要的是 这车基本上什么部件都缺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, don't pull me with it, Lists. Bottom line, it needs everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.03,1:00:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这玩意是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is this thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.62,1:00:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}后挡板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your tombstone.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.46,1:00:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}钛制防弹装甲 保护汽车的燃料电池\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bullet-proof titanium plate, protects your fuel cell.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.05,1:00:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你找到领航员了么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a navigator yet?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.93,1:00:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他有领航员的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell yeah, he does.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.72,1:00:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我他妈的坐前排\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the motherfucker riding shotgun.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.98,1:00:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你他妈的在看什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The hell you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.59,1:00:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我脑子自带防冻剂的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got anti freeze in my brains.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.43,1:00:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们来造这玩意吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's build this shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.65,1:02:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}速度计上限已调整至200英里每小时了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The speedometer has been calibrated to 200 miles per hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.99,1:02:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它就这点本事了么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that all she's got?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.46,1:02:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们来试试看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's find out.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.13,1:02:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}死亡飞车比赛的第一天 绕赛道一圈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This Death race, is one lap, one day.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.84,1:02:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比赛的起点和终点都在飞机场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The race begins and ends at the airfield.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.97,1:02:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}便于加速 障碍很少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice speed here, few obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.35,1:02:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比赛的第二天 在94号州际公路上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Second day, is on Interstate 94.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.60,1:03:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大部分车会在这一段长赛道上报废\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most of ballistic cars will be taken out on this long stretch here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.48,1:03:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小心高速路匪帮 那是他们的地盘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out for the highway gang, this is their turf.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.28,1:03:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后 你就进入下一关"计划"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then, you hit the projects.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.74,1:03:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那里是非常凶险的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All kind of bad boys' in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.58,1:03:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要是活着从那边出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You come out of there alive,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.54,1:03:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就到了肉类包装区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you end up in the Meatpacking District?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.01,1:03:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就能轻松取胜了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home free.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.63,1:03:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}驾驶比杀戮更加重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Driving is more important than killing.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.71,1:03:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}必要的时候才开枪 思考要沉稳 驾驶要迅猛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot only when you must. Think slow, drive fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.43,1:03:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}规则一 保住你的小命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rule no. 1, keep your ass alive.
