Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.23,1:42:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}慢着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.36,1:42:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们派我们两个一起来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They send two of us?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.20,1:42:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了保险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Insurance.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.81,1:42:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}干的很好 是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty well, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.00,1:42:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你的帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And thanks for the assist.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.33,1:43:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每个人都太关注你了 我才有机会赶过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone was so focused on you, I flew under the radar.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.58,1:43:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们赶紧离开这该死的鬼地方吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get the fuck out of this shit hole.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.42,1:43:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弗兰克斯坦死了 干的漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankenstein is dead, job well done.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.22,1:43:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 顺便说一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh and by the way...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.32,1:43:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们现在两清了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are all square now.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.90,1:43:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}20秒钟后我就离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}20 seconds and I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.32,1:44:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}康纳 听好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Connor, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.91,1:44:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}戴上面具 你就是弗兰克斯坦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put on the mask, become Frankenstein.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.54,1:44:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}混乱王国 永远不会追随康纳·吉布森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sprawl, will never follow Connor Gibson.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.92,1:44:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们追随的是弗兰克斯坦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They follow Frankenstein.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.96,1:44:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有他的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without him,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.11,1:44:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一片混乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}chaos.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.34,1:45:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我们结束这场比赛吧 长岛小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's finish this race, Long Beach.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.34,1:46:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 继续直播死亡飞车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, put Death Race, back on live.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.14,1:46:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}金伯格肯定会气死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goldberg is gonna be pissed.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.20,1:46:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他往康纳身上赌了太多钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He put heavy action on Connor.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.22,1:46:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赢钱容易 输钱也容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easily come, easy go.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.56,1:46:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去你妈的 瓦伦丁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck you, Valentine.
